Z||000019||WKDFIRO||01-01-2001||05:32 PM||||No matter what kind of car I see on the road with an accident with another car I always shake my head (those of you who have gone through this know what I mean) because the accident is only the beginning of a string of serious, stinking, squishy, legal BS.<P>Makes one almost beleive in no-fault insurance...<P>From one who has gone through it, my best wishes for a quick settlement!||||reg||8
